ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}¿Lo ves?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Te lo dije, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Das tantas voces que parece que
estás hablando por un megáfono!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Digo yo que a lo mejor podrías
bajar un poquitín el volumen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿no?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Tu vois !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Je te l'avais bien dit !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tu parles tellement fort qu'on dirait
que tu as un mégaphone dans la
gorge !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ça serait vraiment sympa si tu
pouvais baisser d'un ton,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Vedi? Dammi retta, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
parli a voce così alta che sembra
quasi che usi un megafono!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Sarebbe fantastico se potessi
abbassare un po' il volume,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}Gördün mü!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Demiştim sana, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
O kadar bağıra bağıra konuşuyorsun
ki megafondan sesleniyorsun sanki!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Biraz kısabilsen harika olur,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Questa non è mica una voce!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Io sono veramente forte! {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Sono così forte che potrei spostare
una montagna senza versare una
sola goccia di sudore!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Haha! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Das ist kein Gerücht!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Das ist die reine Wahrheit!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich bin sooo stark,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}} dass ich drei
Berge jonglieren und dabei auf
einem Bein hüpfen könnte!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Really?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That's awesome!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}And actually pretty convenient for
me.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} See, I wanna move my house!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
But just a little bit.
Think you can help me with that,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}? {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡¿En serio?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Qué pasada!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Y además me viene muy bien.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Porque quiero mover mi casa
de sitio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Solo un poquitín de nada...
¿Me podrías echar una mano,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}C'est vrai ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dingue !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ça tombe bien que tu dises ça,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
parce que j'aimerais bien déplacer
ma maison, en fait !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
De pas grand-chose en plus. 10 ou
20 mètres grand max. Tu pourrais
m'aider, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cidden mi?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Müthiş!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hem de benim için pek
kullanışlı.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Evimi taşımak istiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ama sadece biraz.
Yardım eder misin, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}? {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Claro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Solo quería apartarla
un metro hacia el sur, tampoco
te pido nada muy complicado.
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Si pudieras hacerlo durante esta
semana me vendría de perlas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0001:01CD}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sì!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vorrei trasferirmi un pochino
più a sud.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Se potessi passare in settimana,
sarebbe grandioso, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0001:01CD}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

